{"team":"LV","col":"#C9D2DC","identity":"balanced","funnel":"balanced-D","plays_pg":58.7,"adot":6.7,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>Matchup-Driven</h2><p><strong>Michael Mayer</strong> is a genuine centerpiece, not an afterthought \u2014 <strong>22%</strong> of targets (league ~15%).</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>They run downhill \u2014 mostly inside the tackles (16% to the edge vs ~25%), a gap/power scheme that trades big plays for a steady, grinding floor.</p><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 61% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><p>By the numbers it's a struggling unit \u2014 a 39% success rate (below the 44% average).</p><p>It's a short, rhythm-based passing game \u2014 aDOT just <strong>6.7</strong> \u2014 that lives on YAC and checkdowns, boosting reception totals over big-play yardage.</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Their red-zone identity is <strong>pass-first</strong> (59% pass), which puts scoring equity on <strong>Tre Tucker</strong>. And with the TE commanding 22% of targets, <strong>Michael Mayer</strong> is a live red-zone option too.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 No Obvious Seam</h2><p>They surrender <strong>118 rushing</strong> and <strong>224 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). No dominant funnel \u2014 read it matchup by matchup.</p><p>They leak <strong>TE touchdowns</strong> (0.32/game vs ~0.24) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><p>They leak <strong>RB rushing TDs</strong> (0.53/game vs ~0.46) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><p>They leak <strong>WR1 receiving TDs</strong> (0.44/game vs ~0.38) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs); <strong>opposing TE anytime-TD</strong> is a repeatable angle.</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Kirk Cousins","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":7,"props":{"Comp":20.41,"Att":30.58,"Pass Yds":225.68,"Pass TD":1.51,"INT":0.56,"Rush Yds":5.84},"d":{"completions":20.41,"attempts":30.58,"pass_yards":225.68,"pass_td":1.51,"interceptions":0.56,"rush_att":2.06,"rush_yards":5.84}}],"RB":[{"name":"Ashton Jeanty","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":38,"props":{"Rush Att":20.06,"Rush Yds":74.41,"Tgt":9.03,"Rec":6.92,"Rec Yds":45.43},"d":{"rush_att":20.06,"rush_yards":74.41,"targets":9.03,"receptions":6.92,"rec_yards":45.43,"rec_td":0.19}},{"name":"Dylan Laube","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":15,"props":{"Rush Att":5.92,"Rush Yds":20.61,"Tgt":2.99,"Rec":2.34,"Rec Yds":16.79},"d":{"rush_att":5.92,"rush_yards":20.61,"targets":2.99,"receptions":2.34,"rec_yards":16.79,"rec_td":0.05}}],"WR":[{"name":"Tre Tucker","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":24,"props":{"Tgt":12.12,"Rec":7.46,"Rec Yds":93.29,"Rec TD":0.28},"d":{"targets":12.12,"receptions":7.46,"rec_yards":93.29,"rec_td":0.28}},{"name":"Jalen Nailor","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":20,"props":{"Tgt":6.81,"Rec":4.26,"Rec Yds":62.16,"Rec TD":0.22},"d":{"targets":6.81,"receptions":4.26,"rec_yards":62.16,"rec_td":0.22}},{"name":"Jack Bech","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":14,"props":{"Tgt":7.73,"Rec":5.24,"Rec Yds":60.86,"Rec TD":0.15},"d":{"targets":7.73,"receptions":5.24,"rec_yards":60.86,"rec_td":0.15}},{"name":"Malik Benson","slot":"WR4","starter":false,"td":12,"props":{"Tgt":5.63,"Rec":3.1,"Rec Yds":38.12,"Rec TD":0.13},"d":{"targets":5.63,"receptions":3.1,"rec_yards":38.12,"rec_td":0.13}},{"name":"Dareke Young","slot":"WR5","starter":false,"td":8,"props":{"Tgt":3.99,"Rec":2.22,"Rec Yds":28.42,"Rec TD":0.08},"d":{"targets":3.99,"receptions":2.22,"rec_yards":28.42,"rec_td":0.08}}],"TE":[{"name":"Michael Mayer","slot":"TE2","starter":false,"td":15,"props":{"Tgt":9.63,"Rec":5.7,"Rec Yds":53.65,"Rec TD":0.16},"d":{"targets":9.63,"receptions":5.7,"rec_yards":53.